# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build context for docker/scorer.Dockerfile.
#
# Scoped to this Dockerfile (BuildKit resolves <dockerfile>.dockerignore before
# <context>/.dockerignore) so it cannot narrow the context of some other image
# built from the same directory later.
#
# Two of these exclusions are correctness, not speed:
#   - acceptance/  is the sealed suite store. It must reach the container as a
#     read-only bind mount at run time, per ticket, never baked into the image.
#     An image carrying every ticket's suite would hand the whole freeze to
#     anyone who could pull it.
#   - results/     holds run records, ledgers and screenshots. None of it may be
#     visible to a scorer whose entire value is being uninformed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

node_modules
dist
*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*

acceptance
results

.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.log

docker/README.md
README.md
